msgid "Ruke se obrišu bez pregovora kad na kuki visi drugar."
msgstr "Hands get dried without an argument when a friend is hanging on the hook."

msgid "Upija, ne samo ukrašava"
msgstr "It absorbs, it does not just decorate"

msgid "Plišana mikrofibra osuši ručice u trenu i ostane sveža do večeri."
msgstr "Plush microfiber dries little hands in an instant and stays fresh till evening."

msgid "Šiven rukom, jedan po jedan"
