msgstr "3 children’s towels (Penguin, Teddy, Chocolate Cookie), Cuddle Puff round pillow in brown, the Teddy long towel in beige, and both Avocado magic cloths"

msgid "Poklon za rođenje, krštenje ili baby shower: tri mekana dečija peškira u obliku životinja sa alkom za kačenje i roze Cuddle Puff jastuk za dečiju sobu."
msgstr "A gift for a birth, christening or baby shower: three soft children’s towels in animal shapes with a hanging loop, and a pink Cuddle Puff pillow for the nursery."

msgid "Dva Cuddle Puff jastuka sa okicama — žuti kružić i sivi kockasti — i dečiji peškir Sova sa alkom za kačenje. Za uređenje dečije sobe ili rođendanski poklon."
msgstr "Two Cuddle Puff pillows with little eyes — a yellow round one and a grey square one — and the Owl children’s towel with a hanging loop. For decorating a kids’ room or as a birthday gift."

msgid "Četiri dečija peškira sa alkom za kačenje: dva za kuku u vrtiću, dva za kuću. Dete svoj peškir prepozna na prvi pogled, a alka ga drži na mestu."
msgstr "Four children’s towels with a hanging loop: two for the kindergarten hook, two for home. A child recognises their towel at a glance, and the loop keeps it in place."

msgid "Za ljubitelje avokada: peškir u obliku prepolovljenog avokada i obe magične krpice sa vezenim avokadom. Mali poklon koji se koristi svaki dan."
msgstr "For avocado lovers: a towel shaped like half an avocado and both magic cloths with an embroidered avocado. A small gift that gets used every day."

msgid "Doručak koji se ne jede: peškiri u obliku tosta, keksa i krofne za ruke u kuhinji i obe magične krpice za radne površine. Šaljiv i praktičan poklon."
msgstr "A breakfast you can’t eat: towels shaped like toast, a cookie and a doughnut for drying hands in the kitchen, and both magic cloths for the worktops. A fun, practical gift."

msgid "Peškiri za celu porodicu: dva duga peškira sa vezenim medom za odrasle i dva dečija peškira sa alkom za mališane. Za novo ili osveženo kupatilo."
msgstr "Towels for the whole family: two long towels with an embroidered teddy for the grown-ups and two children’s towels with a hanging loop for the little ones. For a new or refreshed bathroom."

msgid "Poklon za useljenje: mekani kockasti jastuk za sofu, dva duga peškira za kupatilo i dve magične krpice za kuhinju — po nešto za svaku sobu novog doma."
msgstr "A housewarming gift: a soft square pillow for the sofa, two long towels for the bathroom and two magic cloths for the kitchen — something for every room of the new home."

msgid "Za njega i za nju: dva kockasta Cuddle Puff jastuka i dva duga peškira sa vezenim medom, u paru boja. Poklon za mladence, godišnjicu ili zajednički stan."
msgstr "For him and for her: two square Cuddle Puff pillows and two long towels with an embroidered teddy, in matching pairs of colours. A gift for newlyweds, an anniversary or a first shared flat."

msgid "Mali poklon koji se koristi svaki dan: peškir u obliku lale, roze dugi peškir sa vezenim medom i dve magične krpice. Za vaspitačicu, učiteljicu ili koleginicu."
msgstr "A small gift that gets used every day: a tulip-shaped towel, a pink long towel with an embroidered teddy and two magic cloths. For a kindergarten teacher, a teacher or a colleague."

msgid "Najveći CosyPaw poklon: tri dečija peškira, Cuddle Puff jastuk, dugi peškir i dve magične krpice. Novogodišnji paketić za celu porodicu."
msgstr "The biggest CosyPaw gift: three children’s towels, a Cuddle Puff pillow, a long towel and two magic cloths. A New Year’s gift box for the whole family."

msgid "Poklon paket CosyPaw: sve iz paketa stiže zajedno, u jednoj porudžbini, uz plaćanje pouzećem i dostavu 2–4 dana širom Srbije. Svaki deo je isti kao kad ga kupuješ posebno — dečiji peškiri sa alkom za kačenje, dugi peškiri sa vezenim medom, Cuddle Puff jastuci sa okicama i magične krpice od mikrofibera — samo složen za jednu priliku i jeftiniji u paketu."
msgstr "A CosyPaw gift bundle: everything in it arrives together, in one order, cash on delivery, delivered anywhere in Serbia in 2–4 days. Each piece is exactly what you would get buying it on its own — children’s towels with a hanging loop, long towels with an embroidered teddy, Cuddle Puff pillows with little eyes and microfiber magic cloths — just put together for one occasion and cheaper as a bundle."

